        "custom": "Pokémon"
      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Folha. O aroma picante que se espalha ao redor do pescoço de Bayleef faz com que quem o sinta tenha vontade de lutar. O cheiro liberado pelas folhas também enche as pessoas de energia.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Grama, Monstro &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Bayleef pode evoluir para Meganium no nível 11 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Poison Powder, Razor Leaf, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Synthesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Reflect</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Magical Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Leech Seed, Natural Gift</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Sweet Scent</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Light Screen</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Body Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Aromatherapy, Giga Drain, Safeguard</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Solar Beam</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Slam, Bullet Seed, Charm, Confide, Curse, Double Team, Double-Edge, Echoed Voice, Encore, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Fake Tears, Frustration, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Laser Focus, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Magical Leaf, Mud- Slap, Nature Power, Protect, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snore, Solar Beam, Solar Blade, Stomping Tantrum, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Tera Blast, Toxic, Trailblaze, Work Up, Worry Seed</p>",
